{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to fictional Swedaryn Island! A former colony of the British Empire, it has gained it\u00b4s independence in 1946. The island has a small narrow gauge network connecting communities and industries. You will find farms, forestry, quarry, coal mine and several heavy duty industries, like a sawmill or a breadery. Perhaps the most important is the harbour in Sharadise City. It allows for various imports and exports, and it is the source of fish for the island. The tractors are old, running on steam and there are no cars on the island. Majority of the cargo is transported by trains. Enjoy this tiny island and it\u00b4s many looks, twisting tracks and sharp corners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Included sessions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Island 01 - Introduction - Tutorial<br>Island 02 - Evening Passenger Train - Normal<br>Island 03 - One Short Log - Normal<br>Island 04 - Snowstorm Freight - Expert<br>Island 05 - Harvest Time 1 - Normal<br>Island 06 - Harvest Time 2 -Easy<br>Island 07 - Sharadise City Transit - Easy<br>Island 08 - Harbour Master - Hard<br>Island 09 - Working With Coal - Normal<br>Island 10 - Clay For Brickworks - Normal<br>Island 11 - Bricks To The City Harbour - Easy<br>Island 12 - Shunting at NAAHIIC - Normal<br>Island 13 - Casper Shunter - Expert<br>Island 14 - Food For The People - Expert<br>Island 15 - Historical Tour - Easy<br>Island - Freeroam Spring / Summer / Autumn<br>Island - Freeroam Winter</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759440?t=1748942668","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759440?t=1748942668","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759440/8d9aea9e86863d458bbb85f1449519eebd2ec35a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748942668","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759440/8d9aea9e86863d458bbb85f1449519eebd2ec35a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748942668","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to fictional Swedaryn Island! A former colony of the British Empire, it has gained it\u00b4s independence in 1946. The island has a small narrow gauge network connecting communities and industries. You will find farms, forestry, quarry, coal mine and several heavy duty industries, like a sawmill or a breadery. Perhaps the most important is the harbour in Sharadise City. It allows for various imports and exports, and it is the source of fish for the island. The tractors are old, running on steam and there are no cars on the island. Majority of the cargo is transported by trains. Enjoy this tiny island and it\u00b4s many looks, twisting tracks and sharp corners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Included sessions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Island 01 - Introduction - Tutorial<br>Island 02 - Evening Passenger Train - Normal<br>Island 03 - One Short Log - Normal<br>Island 04 - Snowstorm Freight - Expert<br>Island 05 - Harvest Time 1 - Normal<br>Island 06 - Harvest Time 2 -Easy<br>Island 07 - Sharadise City Transit - Easy<br>Island 08 - Harbour Master - Hard<br>Island 09 - Working With Coal - Normal<br>Island 10 - Clay For Brickworks - Normal<br>Island 11 - Bricks To The City Harbour - Easy<br>Island 12 - Shunting at NAAHIIC - Normal<br>Island 13 - Casper Shunter - Expert<br>Island 14 - Food For The People - Expert<br>Island 15 - Historical Tour - Easy<br>Island - Freeroam Spring / Summer / Autumn<br>Island - Freeroam Winter</p>","developers":["RichardBosnak"],"fullgame":{"appid":"19